Prior art
=========

holonomy-old/ in this repository is the previous generation of this product,
retained read-only as a reference. It is not a dependency of any crate here.
One module (the O_DIRECT alignment rules in crates/holonomy-usb/src/io.rs) was
rewritten from it; no other code was taken.
